menuconfig ZMK_OVERLAY_COMPANION
    bool "ZMK Overlay Companion"
    default n
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    help
      Exposes a small BLE GATT service for companion applications such as
      ZMK Overlay. The service reports the active layer, physical key
      press/release events, resolved modifier state, and protocol capabilities.

      Enable this only on the ZMK device that processes the keymap and
      connects to the host: a normal keyboard, the central half of a split,
      or a dedicated dongle.

      ZMK Studio is required by the desktop application only when manually
      refreshing keymap and physical-layout metadata.

if ZMK_OVERLAY_COMPANION

module = ZMK_OVERLAY_COMPANION
module-str = ZMK Overlay Companion
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_config"

endif
